Package: php-zts-full
Version: @VERSION@
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: @EXTRA_DEPENDS@
Maintainer: mod_apex maintainers <maintainers@example.com>
Description: Self-contained PHP (ZTS + embed SAPI) runtime for mod_apex
 Full PHP build with OPcache + JIT enabled, and the extension set required
 by WordPress, Drupal, and Symfony (curl, mbstring, openssl, PDO/mysqli/
 sqlite3, zip, intl, gd, bcmath, soap, xsl, exif, sodium, gmp, apcu, redis,
 imagick). Installs to /usr/local/php-zts, matching the path mod_apex's
 packaging expects for /usr/local/php-zts/lib/libphp.so.
 .
 This package is generated by tools/build_php_zts_deb.sh from the same
 packaging/build-php-zts.sh script used by the Docker image and the Fedora
 RPM equivalent, so all three stay in sync.
 .
 License: PHP License v3.01 and per-extension upstream licenses (see
 /usr/share/doc/php-zts-full/copyright).
